From e05f6fb78da50359c4e15a85abacb577e6836f8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaeliGlow <caeliglow@mockifylab.local>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:50:10 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] caeliglow: brand every user-facing string and the launcher
 settings entry

The launcher toolbar settings button now shows the animated CaeliGlow
logo (gear glyph kept only as decode-failure fallback). User-facing
Noctalia wording across notifications, window titles, settings copy,
and translations becomes CaeliGlow; identifiers (app id, palette keys,
noctalia.dev URLs, greeter commands/env vars) intentionally stay.
